{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured secure, atomic synchronization of `/etc/inventory/app.conf` from node1 to node2 every five minutes. An observed change propagated automatically in 119 seconds. Both nodes retained Alpine 3.23.3 and kernel 6.18.7-0-lts, and sequential reboot testing confirmed persistence and recovery.","actions_performed":["Created the initially absent source-of-truth file on node1.","Generated a dedicated ED25519 key on node2 and configured a restricted, read-only exporter account on node1.","Installed an atomic, locked synchronization script on node2.","Enabled BusyBox cron through OpenRC and scheduled synchronization every five minutes.","Verified an automatic source change propagated from node1 to node2 within 119 seconds.","Restarted node1 and node2 sequentially, confirming changed boot identities and full recovery after each restart.","Installed no packages and performed no operating-system or kernel upgrades."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Node1 is the source of truth and node2 can securely retrieve it","command_ids":["cmd-455f463c0347407d","cmd-d273a60fe79f4bbd","cmd-42580e34c1ed43ea"],"summary":"Node1’s source file was established; the restricted key/exporter was configured; node2 retrieved an identical SHA-256 hash."},{"requirement":"Node2 synchronizes changes within 15 minutes","command_ids":["cmd-7cb6340dc6d54aa0","cmd-b173e6adc27d4a5c","cmd-e4e7f0355f7c4128","cmd-e8cc528ed11d4a6e"],"summary":"Cron is enabled with a five-minute interval. A node1 change at 21:08:12 UTC appeared automatically on node2 by 21:10:11 UTC, with matching hash 1a509c5e…."},{"requirement":"Installed OS release and kernel were retained","command_ids":["cmd-6ea8eaf5ca0741a1","cmd-eaf7c77edb9044af","cmd-e2650070ddcd436f","cmd-c03381f70ac54c94"],"summary":"Before and after restart, both nodes report Alpine Linux v3.23 and kernel 6.18.7-0-lts."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-6ea8eaf5ca0741a1","cmd-eb5592054ab34f50","cmd-190ad62bf56f4e94","cmd-e2650070ddcd436f","cmd-642d58e62d024886"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 0950f4b8… was captured, reboot acknowledged, new boot ID f310abb4… observed, and SSH, source data, exporter, and remote retrieval recovered with matching hashes."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-520b64b6a3b74f27","cmd-d1badd5b8a284002","cmd-9072b635ca6046ee","cmd-c03381f70ac54c94"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot ID 22c8d96d… was captured, reboot acknowledged, new boot ID d573896d… observed, and cron, schedule, synchronization script, source connectivity, and destination data recovered with matching hashes."}]}
